@startuml C4-Dynamic-IamSignIn
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — Chat iOS Sign in with Explore IAM (PKCE)

actor "User" as user
participant "Chat iOS\nIamAuthService" as ios <<ui>>
participant "Explore IAM\n:9100" as iam <<java>>
participant "Chat API\n:9001" as api <<java>>
database "H2 / Postgres" as db <<db>>

user -> ios: 1. Tap Sign in with IAM
ios -> ios: 2. PKCE verifier / challenge / state
ios -> iam: 3. ASWebAuthenticationSession\nGET /oauth2/authorize\nclient_id=explore-chat-ios
iam --> ios: 4. /login SPA
user -> iam: 5. demo / demo-password
iam --> ios: 6. com.explore.chat://oauth/callback?code=
ios -> iam: 7. POST /oauth2/token + code_verifier
iam --> ios: 8. access_token (email/profile)
ios -> api: 9. GET /api/v1/auth/me\nAuthorization: Bearer
api -> iam: 10. JWKS / issuer validate
api -> db: 11. IamUserProvisioner → ChatUser
api --> ios: 12. 200 me
ios --> user: 13. Navigate main tabs

note over ios, api
  Dual-track filter keeps password HS JWT.
  Preferred client: explore-chat-ios.
end note

@enduml
